1_2413884904465272539_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DmuaV3uvYNwQ7kNvwGzB9dD&_nc_oc=AdoGg9w_34F4YxF2UYploH1qNQif-QBycoewnaH8F9OLiDBs6LMmuVvqT2wcIUOzLL8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYdpcs5BQCYWK5yX8SGIpsmDF37PeaTSntIWn1sJwWqQ&oe=6B047656"}, "display_name": "Alien Extraction", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Theres a big alien mess and somebodies gotta clean it up\u2026\n\nControl an alien infested space station in this lighthearted strategy puzzle game. Guide Lenny the janitor through deadly and dangerous levels: sneak, burn, distract, pilot, blast and clean his way to safety. Control drones, check cameras and complete puzzles to solve the station's mysteries.\n\n- Scour video feeds for alien movement or lost clues\n- Pilot drones to explore, distract aliens and lead Lenny to safety\n- Control the facility from the comfort of your security desk\n- Traverse the facility minimap; just don\u2019t trust it\n- Attempt to mute the station AI when it starts insulting you...", "short_description": "Control an alien infested space station in this lighthearted VR strategy puzzle game. Guide Lenny the janitor through deadly and dangerous levels: sneak, burn, distract, pilot, blast and clean his way to safety. Control drones, check cameras and complete puzzles to solve the station's mysteries."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://alienextraction.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Crooks Peak", "support_website_url": "https://alienextraction.com/bug.html", "website_url": "https://alienextraction.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["NARRATIVE", "PUZZLE", "STRATEGY"],